WEBVTT

00:00:15.570 --> 00:00:16.780
My turn!

00:00:18.360 --> 00:00:21.230
Jack Atlas only has 800 life points.

00:00:21.250 --> 00:00:24.400
And Andore has four Speed Counters this turn.

00:00:25.370 --> 00:00:27.910
I activate Speed World 2's effect!

00:00:28.110 --> 00:00:30.740
By removing four Speed Counters,

00:00:31.540 --> 00:00:35.950
you take 800 
points of damage for every Speed Spell in my hand!

00:00:38.450 --> 00:00:40.830
You lose, Jack Atlas.

00:00:54.790 --> 00:00:55.560
What?

00:01:04.860 --> 00:01:09.200
Unbelievable!  Jack Atlas crashed!

00:01:09.470 --> 00:01:10.510
Damn!

00:01:10.710 --> 00:01:13.110
There really was a malfunction 
with the D-Wheel!

00:01:13.360 --> 00:01:14.370
Yusei...

00:01:16.420 --> 00:01:17.360
Jack!

00:01:17.820 --> 00:01:18.770
Jack!

00:01:18.770 --> 00:01:19.320
Stay back!

00:01:20.720 --> 00:01:22.850
Did you forget the race rules?

00:01:23.360 --> 00:01:28.830
If anyone touches a D-Wheeler during 
the race, we'll be disqualified!

00:01:29.080 --> 00:01:31.450
Return to your position!

00:01:32.420 --> 00:01:33.340
Jack...

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:40.620
Oh my!  Jack Atlas has started 
lifting up his D-Wheel!

00:01:41.590 --> 00:01:43.040
I'm not giving up!

00:01:43.300 --> 00:01:48.730
I won't allow our dreams to end here!

00:02:05.970 --> 00:02:11.080
Every time you're hurt, you can become kinder

00:02:11.440 --> 00:02:16.610
Stand up and you'll understand strength

00:02:16.950 --> 00:02:21.090
Don't look back and keep going

00:02:21.320 --> 00:02:26.920
Both the past and the future 
are connected to the present

00:02:27.090 --> 00:02:31.900
There's no need to fear

00:02:32.130 --> 00:02:39.570
I'll keep telling you that you're not alone

00:02:40.610 --> 00:02:45.540
The passionate emotions in your heart

00:02:46.280 --> 00:02:51.320
Streak to the infinite future

00:02:51.520 --> 00:02:56.720
Dreams surpass their limits

00:02:56.990 --> 00:03:04.830
And will lead you to a bright place

00:03:31.160 --> 00:03:36.760
Burn!
Phoenixian Cluster Amaryllis

00:03:38.550 --> 00:03:42.630
Jack Atlas's D-Wheel isn't working!

00:03:43.560 --> 00:03:48.170
He's pushing his D-Wheel so that they can 
get to their second wheeler Aki Izayoi!

00:03:48.620 --> 00:03:52.470
Jack Atlas's fighting spirit is unbreakable.

00:03:54.500 --> 00:03:56.500
Jack!

00:03:56.500 --> 00:03:57.670
Master Atlas!

00:03:59.110 --> 00:04:00.110
Move out of the way!

00:04:00.110 --> 00:04:01.650
Okay!

00:04:03.800 --> 00:04:05.620
No trespassing beyond this point!

00:04:05.800 --> 00:04:07.420
I'm from the Public Maintenance Department!

00:04:07.580 --> 00:04:09.270
Backstage pass for the press!

00:04:09.270 --> 00:04:10.190
Umm...

00:04:12.780 --> 00:04:15.210
A coffee discount coupon!  See ya!

00:04:16.280 --> 00:04:20.080
Jack Atlas keeps pushing his 
D-Wheel with determination!

00:04:20.250 --> 00:04:23.050
But he's now facing a huge problem!

00:04:23.710 --> 00:04:24.710
It's going to be close.

00:04:24.710 --> 00:04:26.060
What will?

00:04:26.170 --> 00:04:30.110
According to the WRGP 
rules, the opposing team

00:04:30.110 --> 00:04:32.480
gains a Speed Counter for 
every lap you fall behind.

00:04:33.890 --> 00:04:37.440
Team Unicorn has the 
maximum 12 Speed Counters.

00:04:38.260 --> 00:04:42.030
After that, our Speed Counters decrease.

00:04:42.300 --> 00:04:44.340
But we only have 4!

00:04:44.340 --> 00:04:46.080
What happens if it reaches 0?

00:04:46.910 --> 00:04:50.920
When we have 0 Speed Counters, 
we're disqualified.

00:04:51.360 --> 00:04:52.410
No way!

00:04:53.900 --> 00:04:56.130
Our Speed Counters are at maximum.

00:04:56.800 --> 00:05:01.190
Team 5D's countdown to death begins.

00:05:01.340 --> 00:05:06.510
Team 5D's will lose in just four laps!

00:05:06.670 --> 00:05:08.530
Jack, do your best!

00:05:08.530 --> 00:05:09.980
Show your guts!

00:05:13.100 --> 00:05:14.410
Three more laps.

00:05:14.940 --> 00:05:15.690
Aki.

00:05:16.610 --> 00:05:17.640
Get ready.

00:05:17.640 --> 00:05:18.410
Okay!

00:05:27.820 --> 00:05:29.250
Two more laps.

00:05:33.420 --> 00:05:34.720
Are you nervous?

00:05:36.390 --> 00:05:37.310
Yes.

00:05:37.730 --> 00:05:38.570
Look.

00:05:41.120 --> 00:05:43.330
Papa...  Mama...

00:05:44.060 --> 00:05:45.180
You can't!

00:05:45.180 --> 00:05:47.730
A D-Wheel race is dangerous!

00:05:47.730 --> 00:05:49.520
Please, Mama!

00:05:49.520 --> 00:05:54.220
I want to battle on a D-Wheel 
alongside my friends who changed me!

00:05:56.690 --> 00:05:57.720
Understood.

00:05:58.830 --> 00:06:04.160
I want to see you soar with your friends.

00:06:05.810 --> 00:06:08.210
Papa!  Mama!

00:06:10.530 --> 00:06:12.810
You're no longer alone.

00:06:14.270 --> 00:06:15.270
Yusei...

00:06:15.640 --> 00:06:18.280
He's coming!

00:06:20.700 --> 00:06:22.920
Only one lap left!

00:06:22.920 --> 00:06:27.380
Can Jack Atlas pass the 
baton to the second wheeler?

00:06:46.590 --> 00:06:49.480
He's coming!  It's the final corner!

00:06:54.290 --> 00:06:55.320
Do your best!

00:06:57.290 --> 00:07:00.580
I'll carry your hopes with me, Jack!

00:07:01.690 --> 00:07:02.910
I'm counting on you, Aki.

00:07:02.910 --> 00:07:04.930
If he passes you, we'll lose.

00:07:04.930 --> 00:07:07.140
What close timing!

00:07:07.140 --> 00:07:14.070
If Aki Izayoi gives up the lead on 
the first corner, Team 5D's loses!

00:07:29.500 --> 00:07:30.960
They survived!

00:07:30.960 --> 00:07:33.760
Team 5D's survived!

00:07:33.900 --> 00:07:38.380
The second wheeler Aki 
Izayoi's battle now begins!

00:07:39.240 --> 00:07:41.340
Well done, Izayoi.

00:07:41.780 --> 00:07:44.630
Yusei, I leave the rest to you.

00:07:45.070 --> 00:07:45.670
Jack!

00:07:46.110 --> 00:07:47.620
Please take care of Jack!

00:07:47.620 --> 00:07:48.220
Right!

00:07:48.220 --> 00:07:48.980
Jack!

00:07:49.470 --> 00:07:50.350
Move!

00:07:50.350 --> 00:07:51.500
You're in the way!

00:07:51.660 --> 00:07:52.780
Take Jack to the medical office.

00:07:53.280 --> 00:07:54.330
Right!

00:07:55.540 --> 00:07:58.830
The drawback for using Overboost 
at the start now presents itself.

00:07:59.420 --> 00:08:00.450
Well, it's fine.

00:08:01.040 --> 00:08:03.230
Bring it, Aki Izayoi!

00:08:03.770 --> 00:08:04.630
Duel!

00:08:05.960 --> 00:08:07.190
My turn!

00:08:08.790 --> 00:08:11.130
I summon Phoenixian Seed!

00:08:14.180 --> 00:08:17.400
By sending Phoenixian Seed 
to the graveyard, I can

00:08:17.400 --> 00:08:20.720
Special Summon Phoenixian 
Cluster Amaryllis from my hand!

00:08:25.460 --> 00:08:29.480
Phoenixian Cluster Amaryllis 
attacks D.D. Unicorn Knight!

00:08:29.950 --> 00:08:31.080
Flame Petal!

00:08:39.020 --> 00:08:42.520
Phoenixian Cluster Amaryllis's 
effect activates.

00:08:43.050 --> 00:08:48.750
This card is destroyed when it attacks 
you, and you take 800 points of damage.

00:08:49.050 --> 00:08:50.330
Scatter Flame!

00:08:53.700 --> 00:08:54.770
Not bad!

00:08:54.940 --> 00:08:58.130
I set one card and end my turn.

00:08:58.260 --> 00:09:01.740
During this End Phase, I can resurrect 
Phoenixian Cluster Amaryllis...

00:09:01.720 --> 00:09:07.080
...by removing one Plant-Type 
monster in my graveyard from play!

00:09:08.880 --> 00:09:11.850
Phoenixian Cluster Amaryllis resurrects!

00:09:14.550 --> 00:09:15.990
You did it, Aki!

00:09:16.000 --> 00:09:17.360
You're doing well, Aki!

00:09:17.920 --> 00:09:19.580
That girl is good.

00:09:19.580 --> 00:09:21.490
She's attacking quickly.

00:09:21.490 --> 00:09:22.350
She's desperate.

00:09:22.910 --> 00:09:25.310
Andore has 12 Speed Counters.

00:09:25.530 --> 00:09:30.280
Since Andore can use any Speed Spell, 
he has an overwhelming advantage.

00:09:30.600 --> 00:09:34.910
If Andore gains the initiative, 
Aki Izayoi has no chance to win.

00:09:35.330 --> 00:09:37.760
That's why she attacked quickly.

00:09:38.160 --> 00:09:41.990
But Andore anticipated this situation.

00:09:42.510 --> 00:09:47.260
Andore has End of the Storm in his hand.

00:09:47.950 --> 00:09:52.710
When he has 10 or more Speed Counters, all 
monsters on the field are destroyed...

00:09:52.810 --> 00:09:57.790
...and the controller takes 300 points 
of damage for every destroyed monster.

00:09:58.410 --> 00:10:03.720
Andore has no monsters on his field, 
so only Izayoi will take damage.

00:10:05.630 --> 00:10:11.550
When Phoenixian Cluster Amaryllis is 
destroyed, it deals 800 points of damage.

00:10:11.970 --> 00:10:14.780
If I take that, I'll have 
700 life points left.

00:10:15.140 --> 00:10:21.720
If Izayoi has 4 Speed Counters next turn, 
she can use Speed World 2's effect and win.

00:10:22.860 --> 00:10:28.370
In other words, Izayoi wants me to 
destroy Phoenixian Cluster Amaryllis.

00:10:28.750 --> 00:10:32.520
Attack my Phoenixian Cluster Amaryllis.

00:10:32.670 --> 00:10:35.560
You can use a monster or End of the Storm.

00:10:37.680 --> 00:10:40.040
What should I do...

00:10:40.550 --> 00:10:43.130
I'll think about it after I draw.

00:10:43.450 --> 00:10:44.630
My turn!

00:10:47.460 --> 00:10:49.290
I drew a good card.

00:10:49.980 --> 00:10:52.770
I activate Speed Spell - Dash Pilfer!

00:10:53.350 --> 00:10:56.460
When I have 4 or more Speed 
Counters, Dash Pilfer lets

00:10:56.800 --> 00:11:01.010
me gain control of one of your 
monsters in defense position.

00:11:06.480 --> 00:11:08.530
Then I summon Unibird!

00:11:12.210 --> 00:11:13.760
I activate Unibird's effect!

00:11:14.280 --> 00:11:18.250
I remove this card and a 
monster on my field from play.

00:11:18.370 --> 00:11:22.990
I Special Summon a Synchro Monster from 
my graveyard with equal or lower Level!

00:11:23.530 --> 00:11:24.720
No way...

00:11:24.720 --> 00:11:29.710
Not only didn't he use End of the Storm, but 
he took my monster and removed it from play!

00:11:30.330 --> 00:11:33.430
I can't deal him damage!

00:11:33.730 --> 00:11:37.070
I Special Summon Thunder 
Unicorn from my graveyard!

00:11:44.770 --> 00:11:48.030
Thunder Unicorn, attack Aki Izayoi directly!

00:11:48.490 --> 00:11:50.120
Thunder Spear!

00:12:05.850 --> 00:12:09.390
Thunder Unicorn, attack Aki Izayoi directly!

00:12:09.580 --> 00:12:11.050
Thunder Spear!

00:12:21.940 --> 00:12:24.540
I set one card and end my turn.

00:12:25.520 --> 00:12:29.360
Wow!  Not only did he remove her monster 
from play before it could activate its effect...

00:12:29.360 --> 00:12:31.900
...but he used it to Special 
Summon another monster!

00:12:31.900 --> 00:12:36.900
Andore could've used Speed World 
2's effect to win this turn.

00:12:38.430 --> 00:12:39.890
Oh yeah.

00:12:39.890 --> 00:12:44.120
With Dash Pilfer and End of the 
Storm, he has two Speed Spells.

00:12:44.580 --> 00:12:48.880
If he removed 4 Speed Counters 
at a time, Speed World 2's

00:12:48.880 --> 00:12:53.120
effect would've dealt 800 points 
of damage per Speed Spell.

00:12:53.330 --> 00:12:57.230
He could've dealt 1600 points 
of damage three times.

00:12:57.770 --> 00:13:03.330
But if he did that, he would face 
Yusei with 0 Speed Counters.

00:13:03.770 --> 00:13:07.040
That's how much he's worried about Yusei.

00:13:07.450 --> 00:13:10.590
Aki is at a total disadvantage.

00:13:10.780 --> 00:13:12.640
Is there anything she can do, Yusei?

00:13:12.870 --> 00:13:13.990
There is.

00:13:14.230 --> 00:13:17.020
I gave Aki a secret plan before she started.

00:13:17.220 --> 00:13:18.600
What secret plan?

00:13:19.230 --> 00:13:20.490
Watch and learn.

00:13:21.450 --> 00:13:24.660
Use that card to find an opening, Aki.

00:13:25.960 --> 00:13:27.770
He's strong.

00:13:27.930 --> 00:13:30.540
He took over half my life 
points in an instant.

00:13:31.450 --> 00:13:32.350
However...

00:13:33.370 --> 00:13:34.390
Yusei...

00:13:36.610 --> 00:13:38.030
Take this card.

00:13:41.200 --> 00:13:42.400
Yusei, this is-

00:13:42.970 --> 00:13:46.680
The opponent won't expect 
you to use this card.

00:13:46.910 --> 00:13:47.870
That's your chance.

00:13:49.210 --> 00:13:51.500
Enjoy your first Riding Duel,

00:13:52.180 --> 00:13:55.150
Sheesh, I can't enjoy this!

00:13:55.150 --> 00:13:57.140
This strategy is crazy!

00:13:58.070 --> 00:14:01.350
But I do understand your sacrifice.

00:14:01.500 --> 00:14:03.600
I'll live up to your expectations!

00:14:05.080 --> 00:14:06.450
My turn!

00:14:09.180 --> 00:14:10.990
It's here!  I'll attack with this!

00:14:10.990 --> 00:14:14.440
I summon Witch of the 
Black Rose from my hand!

00:14:19.090 --> 00:14:24.720
By summoning Witch of the Black Rose, 
I can draw another card from my deck!

00:14:25.680 --> 00:14:28.170
I drew Rose Fairy.

00:14:29.160 --> 00:14:35.250
When a monster effect adds this card to my 
hand from my deck, I can Special Summon it!

00:14:40.170 --> 00:14:43.520
I activate Speed Spell - Angel Baton!

00:14:46.060 --> 00:14:51.820
When I have 2 or more Speed Counters, I draw 
two cards from my deck and discard one card.

00:14:52.230 --> 00:14:55.960
I discard Glow-Up Bulb from 
my hand to the graveyard!

00:14:56.180 --> 00:15:01.070
Level 4 Witch of the Black 
Rose tunes Level 3 Rose Fairy!

00:15:03.460 --> 00:15:06.660
The cold flame envelops the entire world.

00:15:06.660 --> 00:15:08.920
Black flower, bloom!

00:15:09.940 --> 00:15:10.880
Synchro Summon!

00:15:11.380 --> 00:15:14.550
Appear, Black Rose Dragon!

00:15:17.500 --> 00:15:22.130
Aki Izayoi's ace monster Black 
Rose Dragon has appeared!

00:15:22.140 --> 00:15:26.780
I activate the trap card Star Siphon.

00:15:28.110 --> 00:15:32.320
When a Synchro Monster is 
Special Summoned, I can

00:15:32.320 --> 00:15:36.780
Special Summon a Siphon Token 
and switch their Levels.

00:15:41.100 --> 00:15:47.680
I send the top card in my deck to the 
graveyard to resurrect Glow-Up Bulb!

00:15:50.950 --> 00:15:55.870
Level 1 Glow-Up Bulb tunes 
Level 7 Siphon Token!

00:15:56.600 --> 00:15:59.640
The wishes come together 
to form a new shining star!

00:16:00.860 --> 00:16:01.550
What?

00:16:01.900 --> 00:16:02.540
No way!

00:16:02.540 --> 00:16:03.240
This is...

00:16:03.480 --> 00:16:04.930
Become the path that lights the way!

00:16:05.390 --> 00:16:06.630
Go, Aki!

00:16:06.920 --> 00:16:08.120
Synchro Summon!

00:16:08.810 --> 00:16:11.980
Soar, Stardust Dragon!

00:16:15.800 --> 00:16:16.550
What?

00:16:16.700 --> 00:16:18.250
Stardust Dragon?

00:16:18.930 --> 00:16:23.990
Yusei, as long as I have your 
power, I have nothing to fear!

00:16:23.990 --> 00:16:25.990
Go, Black Rose Dragon!

00:16:26.500 --> 00:16:27.920
Black Rose Flare!

00:16:34.020 --> 00:16:37.200
No way!  If the next attack succeeds-

00:16:37.200 --> 00:16:38.740
Breo, get ready.

00:16:38.740 --> 00:16:39.730
Understood!

00:16:39.840 --> 00:16:41.210
All right!

00:16:41.960 --> 00:16:43.610
Go, Aki!

00:16:43.610 --> 00:16:44.840
I win!

00:16:44.840 --> 00:16:46.090
Stardust Dragon!

00:16:49.760 --> 00:16:52.990
Too bad, but the Battle 
Phase is already over.

00:16:54.240 --> 00:16:58.010
I activated the trap card 
Dimension Equilibrium.

00:16:59.140 --> 00:17:02.160
When a monster is destroyed in battle...

00:17:02.670 --> 00:17:08.330
I can remove the attacking monster from 
play to resurrect the destroyed monster!

00:17:10.790 --> 00:17:13.280
Next, the Battle Phase ends.

00:17:13.600 --> 00:17:15.790
What a terrifying effect!

00:17:17.380 --> 00:17:20.340
I set two cards and end my turn.

00:17:24.210 --> 00:17:25.940
That scared me.

00:17:26.660 --> 00:17:31.340
Yusei Fudo, you quickly 
constructed this clever plan.

00:17:40.300 --> 00:17:42.370
So no more mercy.

00:17:42.870 --> 00:17:45.100
Even Jean is getting nervous.

00:17:45.670 --> 00:17:49.740
We never expected Stardust Dragon to appear.

00:17:50.080 --> 00:17:52.010
That was clever!

00:17:52.630 --> 00:17:53.880
My turn!

00:17:55.260 --> 00:17:57.910
I activate Speed Spell - Speed Energy!

00:17:58.730 --> 00:18:02.030
When I have 2 or more Speed Counters, my

00:18:02.030 --> 00:18:07.130
monster gains 200 attack points 
for each Speed Counter.

00:18:07.370 --> 00:18:09.040
I have 12 Speed Counters!

00:18:09.220 --> 00:18:13.140
Therefore, Thunder Unicorn 
gains 2400 attack points!

00:18:19.500 --> 00:18:21.840
4600 attack points?

00:18:22.120 --> 00:18:24.320
Go, Thunder Unicorn!

00:18:24.320 --> 00:18:26.090
Thunder Spear!

00:18:29.400 --> 00:18:32.040
I activate the trap Half Counter!

00:18:35.200 --> 00:18:42.250
With Half Counter, Stardust Dragon gains 
half of Thunder Unicorn's original attack points!

00:18:48.270 --> 00:18:49.690
Aki!

00:18:49.710 --> 00:18:51.770
She has 800 life points left.

00:18:52.760 --> 00:18:56.390
He has all his Speed Counters!  
He also has Speed Spells!

00:18:57.130 --> 00:18:57.950
Aki...

00:18:58.950 --> 00:19:00.910
This battle is over.

00:19:02.230 --> 00:19:05.990
Even if I'm going to lose, I have 
to do something about that card.

00:19:06.320 --> 00:19:09.570
I activate Speed World 2's effect!

00:19:10.390 --> 00:19:17.830
By removing 4 Speed Counters, you take 800 
points of damage for every Speed Spell in my hand!

00:19:17.830 --> 00:19:20.190
I activate the trap Wicked Rebirth!

00:19:20.190 --> 00:19:20.770
What?

00:19:21.640 --> 00:19:23.980
I pay 800 life points to Special Summon a

00:19:24.210 --> 00:19:29.610
Synchro Monster without its 
effects from my graveyard!

00:19:36.300 --> 00:19:38.020
Return to the field!

00:19:39.400 --> 00:19:41.000
Stardust Dragon!

00:19:48.060 --> 00:19:50.070
What an ending!

00:19:50.070 --> 00:19:54.230
Aki Izayoi destroyed herself 
and has to leave the course!

00:19:57.030 --> 00:19:58.530
She didn't destroy herself.

00:19:58.710 --> 00:20:04.370
By avoiding my attack, I have less Speed 
Counters, and she left Stardust Dragon for Yusei.

00:20:05.410 --> 00:20:08.810
Aki Izayoi, your spirit is amazing.

00:20:13.930 --> 00:20:15.710
I'm sorry, Yusei.

00:20:16.080 --> 00:20:18.350
I couldn't do anything.

00:20:18.970 --> 00:20:20.330
That's not true!

00:20:20.940 --> 00:20:22.400
Lua is right.

00:20:27.850 --> 00:20:29.780
I understand your passion.

00:20:30.270 --> 00:20:31.890
Leave the rest to me.

00:20:40.590 --> 00:20:41.820
Aki...

00:20:46.690 --> 00:20:47.530
Hey.

00:20:48.960 --> 00:20:50.080
Look.

00:20:50.800 --> 00:20:53.960
Aki!  Well done!

00:20:53.960 --> 00:20:56.740
Aki, you were cool!

00:21:12.510 --> 00:21:15.640
Thank you, Papa and Mama.

00:21:17.230 --> 00:21:18.210
Everyone.

00:21:22.150 --> 00:21:25.660
But what a situation!

00:21:25.920 --> 00:21:29.160
Who could've expected this?

00:21:29.160 --> 00:21:34.110
We expected a close battle, but Team 
Unicorn has an overwhelming lead!

00:21:34.290 --> 00:21:38.070
In order for Team 5D's 
to make a comeback, the

00:21:38.250 --> 00:21:43.400
last wheeler Yusei Fudo has 
to defeat three opponents!

00:22:08.240 --> 00:22:12.910
The small cliff floats on the Milky Way

00:22:12.910 --> 00:22:17.920
The sights I see are different 
than what I imagined

00:22:18.180 --> 00:22:22.820
Were you able to move on from the past?

00:22:22.820 --> 00:22:27.830
The answer isn't no, but 
there's something missing

00:22:28.030 --> 00:22:32.700
The cruel god tests us

00:22:33.000 --> 00:22:39.640
Let's fill the emptiness 
and head to the next stage

00:22:39.640 --> 00:22:43.510
If you ask me "What's our relationship?"

00:22:43.510 --> 00:22:49.350
We're more than friends... 
but that's not quite right

00:22:49.510 --> 00:22:53.250
Bond is the proper word

00:22:53.250 --> 00:22:59.220
As we fight, we understand each other

00:22:59.220 --> 00:23:02.190
"Where are you right now?"  "On Earth"

00:23:02.190 --> 00:23:04.430
Because I'm not an astronaut

00:23:04.430 --> 00:23:09.100
I have no problems when 
I'm below the ozone layer

00:23:09.400 --> 00:23:11.970
"I know, I'm coming right away."

00:23:11.970 --> 00:23:15.440
You want to party until the morning

00:23:15.440 --> 00:23:18.640
At our special place
